"The login is made between %s and rclone on this computer: the browser hands "
"the answer back to rclone here, and rclone keeps it in its own settings, "
"~/.config/rclone/rclone.conf. The program never sees it. rclone logs in as "
"its own app, which everyone who uses rclone shares, so the service may slow "
"it down at busy times."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:807 src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:837
msgid ""
"rclone saves as it goes, also when stopped half way. If something went "
"wrong, remove the half-made setup with rclone config delete and its name, "
"and start again."
