"under ~/%s, rclone cannot mount there."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:983
msgid "Set Up a Cloud Service With rclone"
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:984
msgid ""
"rclone is a program that keeps a folder in step with a cloud service. Its "
"source code is open, the system keeps it up to date, it logs in on this "
"computer only, and it can encrypt your files before they leave."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:987
msgid ""
"This page goes through it step by step. You run the commands yourself, in a "
"terminal: rclone asks its own questions and writes its own settings. The "
"program writes nothing and never sees your login."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: %s is a cloud service, e.g. "Jottacloud".
#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1056
#, c-format
msgid "%s: add the shareable disk"
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1057
#, c-format
msgid "%s: mount at each login"
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1064
msgid ""
"Every service this page knows how to set up is reached through rclone "
"already, and mounted at each login. They are in the report."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1068
msgid "Which cloud service?"
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1076
msgid "Next"
msgstr ""

