#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1454
msgid ""
"It stopped before every name was looked at, since there are very many or the "
"service answered slowly."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1477
msgid "Asking the service… With many files, this can take a few minutes."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: %s is a cloud service, e.g. "Dropbox".
#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1492
#, c-format
msgid "Secrets at %s"
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1495
#, c-format
msgid ""
"What is in the encrypted folder at %s is encrypted before it leaves. "
"Anything outside it, the provider can read, and a key or a stored login "
"there would be in its reach."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1498
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The provider can read what is at %s, and a key or a stored login there would "
"be in its reach."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:1502
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The program can ask %s for the names of its files, outside the encrypted "
"folder, and see whether any look like secrets. Only the names are looked at, "
"never the content, since reading it would fetch every file. It asks over the "
"network, with rclone and rclone's own login, and only when you press the "
"button. No name is kept but those that look like secrets."
msgstr ""

